      "content": "Since you have a deep cut from a rusty object, it is very important to seek professional medical attention immediately instead of treating it at home. You should thoroughly wash the area with soap and running water right away and cover it with a clean bandage, but please see a doctor to check for tetanus and ensure it is properly cleaned. Deep wounds carry a higher risk of serious infection, and only a healthcare provider can properly assess your injury.",
